        "original_id": "04d4be3e-d328-54a2-98c5-705ad4e4f37d",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Jun Ji-hyun, Gianna Jun, Wang Ji-hyun, Kwak Jae-yong, Cha Tae-hyun\n- Works: My Sassy Girl\n- Roles: The Girl\n- Topics: South Korean actresses, South Korean romantic comedy films\n\nFacts:\n- Wang Ji-hyun was born on 30 October 1981 and is a South Korean actress known as Jun Ji-hyun and Gianna Jun.\n- In 2001, Jun Ji-hyun rose to fame for playing The Girl in the romantic comedy film My Sassy Girl.\n- My Sassy Girl is a 2001 South Korean romantic comedy film directed by Kwak Jae-yong and starring Jun Ji-hyun and Cha Tae-hyun.\n- My Sassy Girl was one of the highest-grossing Korean comedies of all time.\n- The Korean title of My Sassy Girl is 엽기적인 그녀, which literally means \"That Bizarre Girl\".",
